# The boot set the Node's own microVM form is (ADR 0034, 0054): mvmd's `boot_sets` names it, and a
# Machine created with `os_boot` boots it (mvmd ADR 0058). Its kernel is built by
# image/node/kernel/build.sh and its initrd by image/node/initramfs/build.sh; the host image
# places both and writes boot-sets.json (image/host/initramfs/build.sh). The name is 1 to 63
# characters of [a-z0-9-].
#
# Moved by: the PM, in a pull request that changes what the Node's microVM form is called.
GUEST_BOOT_SET=naru-node
